Package: tflplanner
Type: Package
Title: A 'shiny' Editor for 'rtfreporter' Table and Report Definitions
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(given  = "Yoichi",
           family = "Masui",
           email  = "ichi.r.pro@gmail.com",
           role   = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: A 'shiny' application that keeps each clinical study in a
    folder of its own -- input data, definitions, programs, deliverables
    and logs -- and writes the definition workbooks
    that 'rtfreporter' builds clinical tables from: the table definition
    ('table_spec.xlsx': the table, its variables, cells, layout, columns,
    style and column header) and the report definition
    ('report_spec.xlsx': the report list, page, running header and footer,
    titles and footnotes). From the same definition it writes one R program
    per report, which reads the two workbooks and writes the report's RTF,
    and 'autoexec_report.R', which runs them all.
